{"id":"u-0608fcea-5ca7-4545-86b8-b19a9526c808","src":"community","title":"BRICK","author":"Changachinito","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/afdirV-brick","desc":"Over the next 8 weeks, you will stack bricks and become a more complete athlete. We will be pushing 6 core movements: Squat, Jump, Sprint, Strict Press, Deadlift, Bench. For compound lifts, we will add exactly 1 rep each week for each movement, doing 6 sets of strength work and 3 sets of speed work. This rate of progress minimizes the chances of injuries and maximizes your chances of a successful PR. You will be lifting the same weights for 7 weeks straight and mastering each weight jump. KILL YOUR EGO. For the strength sets, use a weight you can confidently hit 6 triples with. For the speed sets, technique still needs to be crisp and mechanically sound while moving as fast as possible. Figure out your working weights and STICK TO THEM. WE DO NOT TRAIN TO FAIL OUR CORE LIFTS. \n\nMy accessories are programmed to target common weak spots and I highly recommend to experiment with variations that suit yourself. That being said,  PUSH EVERY ACCESSORY HARD. With stable isolations, we can go to failure without frying our CNS so DO IT. \n\nDon't forget to check in with your body every day and work on the weak spots. \n\nIf you have any questions please feel free to DM me @ty.v.gravity","level":["Intermediate","Novice","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Athletics","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness","Olympic Weightlifting"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":6,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-29T09:13:48.840Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower Strength","Upper Strength","Lower Dynamic","Upper Dynamic","Structural"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Monster Walk","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]},{"n":"Vertical Jump To Broad Jump","sets":[{"r":2,"x":3}],"note":"EXPLODE"}]},{"n":"Zercher Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6},{"r":6,"pct":60,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Hip Adductor (Machine)","set